Entries of a dependentRequired keyword must be arrays of strings,
and entries of a dependentSchemas keyword must be schemas.
The error for a dependentRequired entry which is a schema
says that a schema is expected, and the error for an entry of any other kind
says that an array or schema is expected, whichever the keyword.

-- schema.json --
{
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "dependentRequired": {
        "a": {"type": "string"},
        "b": true,
        "c": 1234
    },
    "dependentSchemas": {
        "d": ["e"],
        "f": 1234
    }
}
-- out/decode/extract --
ERROR:
expected schema but got struct:
    schema.json:4:10
expected schema but got bool:
    schema.json:5:10
dependency value must be array or schema. found int:
    schema.json:6:10
expected schema but got list:
    schema.json:9:10
dependency value must be array or schema. found int:
    schema.json:10:10
